cue Rice Crisps | Baker\u0027s $2.49 and Family Fare $2.59 / 2.6 oz = ~$15.3/lb -\u003e rice [lb, band 0.4-4]: OUT-OF-BAND. (9) Quaker Tomato \u0026 Basil Rice Cakes 6.1 Oz | Family Fare | $4.69 = $12.3/lb -\u003e tomatoes [lb, band 0.6-4.5]: OUT-OF-BAND.",
