-                      "resolution_note":  "Round-2 adjudication of all 17 contested products, each routed in array order with its raw row: 8 route correctly, 9 misroute. None held a cell; what protected the board was 4 band drops + 5 unit-refusals, and for the in-band wrong candidates only price levels - the sharpest being De La Rosa marshmallows at 0.22/oz inside strawberries, already beating two real strawberry rows today. Root causes: 7 tokens the class library could not express, a bake 2,165 patterns behind the library (why garlic missed the existing jerky token), and category-scoping holes needing per-commodity tokens. Shipped: 7 library tokens + apples exempt + 20 commodity exclude tokens + 2 refried-beans includes + full re-bake, measured over 26,003 names: 130 routing corrections, zero live cell items ejected, four decided cell corrections (mixed-nuts x3 including a crown flip and the Aldi rename continuity, pickled-jalapenos Baker\u0027s bean-can eviction), zero new guard fires. Bake currency is now a watched invariant with a must-fire fixture. Bands: unchanged; premise disproven (strawberries and milk bands exist and fired - candidates-file stamps prove it).",
